:: Carter Bedroom Collectables Cool [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You stand in front of one of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s shelves full of collectables, nodding along as you look at each one. The boy has everything from figures to limited run comics to memorabilia from his favorite franchises, mainly things that are or are around Ultraman. It’s a pretty impressive collection and you ask him how he was able to afford it all. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I spent a lot of my allowance on this stuff.”</span> He laughs nervously, rubbing the back of his head, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But some of the older stuff was actually given to me by my grandfather. He and his brother collected this stuff when they were younger, but he couldn’t take it when he moved. It was a few years ago when they gave it to me, I was already obsessed so it worked out.”</span> He laughs. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Then I just pick up stuff when I can. I know it’s a little weird, haha.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightGreen">You tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> that even if it is a little weird, it’s pretty cool that he has something he’s so passionate about and has quite a collection of cool and unique collectables. It feels like you’re in a museum and keep finding something new! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> blushes as you call his collection cool, smiling as he looks down at his feet with pride. He seems to care a lot about his collection, even if he can tell it’s a bit much.</span> <br>

<span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 5>>
<span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
<<needChange "Fun" 5>>
<<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
